To measure from node (a whole number) with depth (a whole number).
If node is less than 0, return.
If depth is more than height, set height to depth.
Measure from item node of lefts with depth plus 1.
Measure from item node of rights with depth plus 1.

To mark from node (a whole number) with level (a whole number) and place (a whole number).
If node is less than 0, return.
Set item node of depths to level.
Set item node of places to place.
The steps is tall minus 2 minus level.
The gap is shift 1 left by steps.
The leftplace is place minus gap.
The rightplace is place plus gap.
Mark from item node of lefts with level plus 1 and leftplace.
Mark from item node of rights with level plus 1 and rightplace.

To find at row (a whole number) with column (a whole number).
